Subject: [PATCH 4/7] Command grab (G): seize, swing round, unblockable throw;
 NPCs grab turtles

grab.rs: the nearest enemy in front within 1.45 m is seized at 0.3 s
(both hands on its shoulders, fingers closed on them) unless it is
dodging, down or dead; it is held at arm's length and swung through
1.4 rad, then thrown at 0.75 s on ual2/OverhandThrow's release by a
HitKind::Grab hit that goes through any guard (7.5 m/s: ragdoll range).
A whiff ends early; a hit on the grabber lets go. The AI closes in and
grabs a foe that keeps its guard up for 1.2 s.

